@startuml
title VC Mint & Revocation

participant "Identity Module" as ID
participant "VC Registry" as VC
participant "Status Registry" as SR
participant "Wallet" as Wallet

ID -> VC: MintVC(did, schema)
VC -> VC: Record issuance
VC -> SR: Update revocation tree root
SR -> Wallet: Notify new proof root
Wallet -> SR: Query VC status via light client

== Revocation ==
ID -> VC: RevokeVC
VC -> SR: Update revocation root
SR -> Wallet: Provide Merkle proof of revocation

@enduml
